{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47776","headline":"醉吟 · 酒肆布衣","name":"醉吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳春时节天气和，万物芳盛人如何。\n素秋时节天地肃，荣秀丛林立衰促。\n有同人世当少年，壮心仪貌皆俨然。\n一旦形羸又发白，旧游空使泪连连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"酒肆布衣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}